  "description": "Embeddable HTTP server and client for .NET in the polyglot CoAkka ecosystem. Serve HTTP/1.1, HTTP/2 and HTTP/3 on one TLS port, or use standalone listeners for streaming, SSE, WebSockets, upload, file delivery and outbound requests. Targets .NET 8; includes five native targets, Core SDK 2.3.0 and ABI 10.",
